WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,080
Li Mo, I know I was wrong

2
00:00:02,400 --> 00:00:03,920
I was obsessed with it at first

3
00:00:03,920 --> 00:00:06,520
But I was forced by Xingchen

4
00:00:07,390 --> 00:00:08,710
I still love you

5
00:00:08,990 --> 00:00:11,390
Can you please forgive me?

6
00:00:11,950 --> 00:00:14,470
Please, I don't want to die in this damn place

7
00:00:15,030 --> 00:00:17,630
What does it have to do with me Lu Yang

8
00:00:17,950 --> 00:00:19,110
Don't think I don't know

9
00:00:19,310 --> 00:00:20,950
Don't you know you are wrong?

10
00:00:22,320 --> 00:00:24,680
You just know you're going to die

11
00:00:24,840 --> 00:00:28,280
Brother, don’t be angry. Don’t be angry.

12
00:00:28,850 --> 00:00:30,650
Okay, my brother is not angry.

13
00:00:31,870 --> 00:00:33,030
Forced by Xingchen

14
00:00:33,810 --> 00:00:35,210
The day the flood came up

15
00:00:35,410 --> 00:00:36,970
You locked Yaya in the room

16
00:00:37,090 --> 00:00:38,330
I want to drown it alive

17
00:00:38,570 --> 00:00:39,970
This is what Xingchen forces you to do.

18
00:00:40,250 --> 00:00:44,390
Yaya, are you here next to me?

19
00:00:44,550 --> 00:00:46,790
I am Lu Yang’s sister Yaya
